Package: agristat
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Biostatistical Suite for Agricultural and Genetic Research
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-04-07
Authors@R: person("Lung An", "Lung Pg", email = "lunganlungpg@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package implementing all six AgriStat modules for
    agricultural research: (1) data ingestion with hypothesis tracking and assumption
    testing, (2) field layout engine for agricultural experimental designs,
    (3) breeding/genetics analytics including AMMI and heritability calculations,
    (4) mean separation and post-hoc statistical tests, (5) phylogenetics and
    evolutionary mapping, and (6) automated thesis output generation. The package
    provides publication-ready statistical analysis workflows following R best
    practices.
